following table sets forth the cash and non-cash compensation for fiscal years ended December 28, 2024 and December 30, 2023, earned
by each person who served as Chief Executive Officer during fiscal 2024, and our other most highly compensated executive officer who
held office as of December 28, 2024 (&#8220;named executive officers&#8221;):</span></p>

